#: ../../tools/cran_tools.rst:32 cde3b2b101994173bd045d730e591484
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get metadata for a CRAN R package from the CRAN database"
" (crandb). Returns package title, version, description, authors, license,"
" dependencies (Imports, Suggests, Depends), URL, publication date, and "
"release history. CRAN hosts 20,000+ R packages for statistical computing,"
" bioinformatics, data visualization, and machine learning. Use for "
"discovering R package information, checking versions, and finding "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

